# Generated part meshes + manifest (R1 build:parts) are per-host build artifacts
# regenerated by `npm run build:parts` (incl. on the VPS); never committed (a
# committed manifest would reference STL binaries that aren't in the repo).
parts/
!parts/
!parts/pendent-head-k56.stl
!parts/parts-manifest.json
# Auto-source loop runtime status (S5) — per-host observability artifact written
# by `npm run auto-source`; surfaced via GET /api/auto-source/status, never committed.
out/
# Browser smoke screenshots and temporary downloads are local verification artifacts.
output/playwright/
# Local-only preview helpers (may contain dev credentials)
scripts/preview-server.js
.claude/
data/state/

# Proprietary bid workbooks + vendor pricebooks (source-of-truth data; present on dev + VPS, never committed)
*.xlsx
*.docx
